---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/ui/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { agentSystemsLab as collection, agentSystemsJourney as journey, infoooIdentity } from '../../data/infooo';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
import { url, img } from '../../utils/url';
import { absoluteUrl, personReference } from '../../utils/seo';
import { pageSchema } from '../../utils/schema';
const context = { site: Astro.site!, base: import.meta.env.BASE_URL };
const path = `/infooo/${collection.slug}`;
const start = journey[0].world;
const total = journey.length;
const worldPath = (slug: string) => `/infooo/${slug}`;
const schema = pageSchema({ type: 'CollectionPage', path, name: collection.title, description: collection.description, primaryImage: collection.socialImage, breadcrumbs: [{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Infooo', path: '/infooo' }, { name: collection.title, path }], extra: { creator: personReference(context), mainEntity: { '@type': 'ItemList', name: `${collection.title} learning journey`, numberOfItems: total, itemListElement: journey.map(entry => ({ '@type': 'ListItem', position: entry.position, name: entry.world.title, url: absoluteUrl(worldPath(entry.world.slug), context) })) } } }, context);
---
<BaseLayout title="Agent Systems Lab — AI Agent Security & Reliability | Khizooology" description={collection.description} canonical={absoluteUrl(path, context)} accentColor={infoooIdentity.color} accentColorLight={infoooIdentity.colorLight} ogImage={collection.socialImage} ogImageAlt={collection.preview.alt} socialTitle="Agent Systems Lab — Interactive AI Agent Architecture" socialDescription={collection.description} jsonLd={schema}>
  <div class="asl k-container" style={`--k-button-accent:${infoooIdentity.color}`}>
    <Breadcrumb crumbs={[{ label: 'Infooo', href: url('/infooo') }, { label: collection.title }]} accentColor={infoooIdentity.color}/>
    <section class="asl-hero" aria-labelledby="asl-title">
      <p class="asl-eyebrow">INFOOO · CURATED COLLECTION</p>
      <h1 id="asl-title">{collection.title}</h1>
      <p class="asl-headline">{collection.headline}</p>
      <p class="asl-credit">Built by <a href={url('/my-portfolio')}>{SITE.author} — professional work</a> / {SITE.name}.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="asl-section" id="journey" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
      <header>
        <h2 id="problem-title">Which problem should I explore first?</h2>
        <p>Choose any problem. Numbers suggest an order; you do not need to complete earlier cases.</p>
        <p>Not sure? <a href={url(worldPath(start.slug))} data-infooo-collection={collection.slug} data-collection-action="start">Start with tool access</a>.</p>
      </header>
      <ol class="asl-cases">
        {journey.map((entry, index) => {
          const next = journey[index + 1];
          return <li><article>
            <a class="asl-case-entry" href={url(worldPath(entry.world.slug))} aria-labelledby={`problem-${entry.world.id}`} aria-describedby={`lesson-${entry.world.id}`} data-infooo-collection={collection.slug} data-collection-action="world">
              <span class="asl-step">Suggested {entry.position} / {total} · {entry.world.title}</span>
              <h3 id={`problem-${entry.world.id}`}>{entry.problem}</h3>
              <p id={`lesson-${entry.world.id}`}>{entry.takeaway}</p>
              <span class="asl-open">Open case <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            </a>
            <details class="asl-case-depth"><summary>Question to investigate</summary><p>{entry.question}</p></details>
            {next && <p class="asl-next"><span>Another angle:</span> <a href={url(worldPath(next.world.slug))} data-infooo-collection={collection.slug} data-collection-action="world">{next.label}</a><small>{next.takeaway}</small></p>}
          </article></li>;
        })}
      </ol>
    </section>
    <section class="asl-section asl-system" aria-labelledby="system-title">
      <h2 id="system-title">How the cases connect</h2>
      <p>Each case uses its own fictional scenario and state. The connection is architectural: tools, context, identity, policy and workflow state shape what an agent can do. These are separate experiments, not one continuous incident.</p>
      <details class="asl-overview"><summary>Explore the architecture and failure chain</summary>
        <p>A model is only one part of an agent system.</p>
        <p class="asl-equation">Model + tools + context + identity + policy + state + external systems <strong>= agent system</strong></p>
        <p>Failures can compound: untrusted input can influence a tool action, broad authority can increase its reach, and retries can repeat a side effect. Incident response helps reconstruct the evidence and verify recovery. This is an illustrative relationship, not an inevitable sequence.</p>
        <figure><img src={img(collection.preview.asset)} alt={collection.preview.alt} width="760" height="470" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><figcaption>A shared architectural view. Each case runs independently.</figcaption></figure>
      </details>
    </section>
    <section class="asl-section asl-truth"><h2>Deep knowledge. Clear boundaries.</h2><p>Each lab distinguishes <b>Fact</b>, <b>Model</b> and <b>Simulation</b>, with its own maintained sources and limitations. These fictional browser-only experiments demonstrate architectural relationships; they are not security certifications or predictions of a specific model. No accounts, real agents or private inputs are needed.</p></section>
    <section class="asl-consult" aria-labelledby="consult-title"><div><p class="asl-eyebrow">BUILDING PRODUCTION AI AGENTS?</p><h2 id="consult-title">Bring the system into focus.</h2><p>Security, reliability, identity, authorization, context, tooling and incident response are connected architecture questions.</p><p><strong>{SITE.author}</strong><br/>AI-agent security, reliability & system design</p></div><div class="asl-actions"><a class="k-button k-button--primary k-button--brand" href={url(collection.contactPath)} data-infooo-collection={collection.slug} data-collection-action="consulting">Work with Khizar</a><a href={url('/my-portfolio')}>Explore professional work →</a></div></section>
    <p class="asl-back"><a href={url('/infooo')}>← Explore all Infooo worlds</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.asl{padding-block:1rem 2.5rem;color:var(--k-text)}
.asl-hero{max-width:80ch;padding-block:1.25rem}
.asl-eyebrow{font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:800;color:var(--k-text-muted);margin:0 0 .6rem}
h1{font:900 clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3.5rem)/1.1 Poppins,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0 0 .75rem}
.asl-headline{font:800 clamp(1.1rem,2vw,1.5rem)/1.45 Poppins,sans-serif;margin:0 0 .75rem}
.asl-credit,.asl-section>p,.asl-section header>p,.asl-consult p,.asl-overview p{color:var(--k-text-muted);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.8;max-width:85ch}
.asl-credit{font-size:.75rem;margin:0}
.asl-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;margin:1.2rem 0}
.asl a{color:var(--k-text);text-underline-offset:4px}
.asl a:focus-visible,.asl summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--k-text);outline-offset:4px}
.asl-section{padding-block:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--k-border);scroll-margin-top:100px}
h2{font:800 clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.65rem)/1.4 Poppins,sans-serif;margin:0 0 .6rem}
h3{font:800 1rem/1.45 Poppins,sans-serif;margin:.4rem 0}
.asl-cases{list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;margin:1rem 0 0}
.asl-cases li{min-width:0}
.asl-cases article{height:100%;border:1px solid var(--k-border);border-top:3px solid var(--m-infooo);border-radius:14px;background:var(--k-bg-card)}
.asl-case-entry{display:block;padding:1rem;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px}
.asl-case-entry:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--m-infooo) 5%,var(--k-bg-card))}
.asl-step{font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--k-text-muted)}
.asl-case-entry p,.asl-case-depth p{font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--k-text-muted);margin:.5rem 0}
.asl-open{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}
.asl-case-depth{padding:0 1rem}
.asl summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;padding-block:.7rem}
.asl-next{border-top:1px solid var(--k-border);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin:0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.7}
.asl-next>span{color:var(--k-text-muted)}
.asl-next a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font-weight:700}
.asl-next small{display:block;color:var(--k-text-muted);font-size:.78rem}
.asl-equation{padding:1rem;border-radius:12px;background:var(--k-bg-card);border:1px solid var(--k-border)}
.asl-equation strong{display:block;color:var(--k-text);margin-top:.3rem}
.asl figure{margin:1rem 0;max-width:760px}
.asl figure img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--k-border);border-radius:20px}
.asl figcaption{font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--k-text-muted);margin-top:.5rem}
.asl-consult{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--k-border);border-radius:18px;background:var(--k-bg-card)}
.asl-consult .asl-actions{flex-direction:column;align-items:start;flex-shrink:0}
.asl-consult .asl-actions>a:not(.k-button),.asl-back a{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:.8rem}
.asl-back{font-size:.8rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
@media(max-width:1100px){.asl-consult{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem}.asl-consult .asl-actions{flex-shrink:1;flex-direction:row}}
@media(max-width:650px){.asl-cases{grid-template-columns:1fr}.asl-consult{padding:1rem}.asl-actions .k-button{max-width:100%}.asl-section{padding-block:1.1rem}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.asl *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
